section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.39.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">August 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spider_Tree\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" /></a></span> Spider Tree</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Spider Tree</b> is a tree found in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>. It was released for the 2025 Halloween event, and when chopped down, drops <a href=\"/wiki/Spiders\" title=\"Spiders\">spiders</a> ,<a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Webs\" title=\"Spider Webs\">spider webs</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Plastic_Spiders\" title=\"Plastic Spiders\">plastic spiders</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling_Price\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Hexagon_Dollar.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616024527\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Dollar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Dollar.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Dollar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Hexagon_Dollar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616024527\" /></a></span>Selling Price</span></h2>\n<p>The selling price of Spider trees (raw, sanded, and planked) can vary day to day. See the stock market located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a> to see the exact price of Spider on a particular day. The price listed on the wiki is the <u>default</u> price for selling raw or processed Spider Tree Wood.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Logged (Raw) - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">~🍬1.164/stud³</span>.</li>\n<li>Sanded - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">~🍬22.93/stud³</span>.</li>\n<li>Planked - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">~🍬28.51/stud³</span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foraging\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9b/Hexagon_Forage.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605035628\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Forage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Forage.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Forage.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9b/Hexagon_Forage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605035628\" /></a></span> Foraging</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Spiders\" title=\"Spiders\">Spiders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Webs\" title=\"Spider Webs\">Spider Webs</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Accessibility\">Accessibility</span></h2>\n<p>Certain trees require specific conditions to obtain them, whether it be a specific axe or a weather condition. Detailed spawn conditions and other concerns (such as the relative difficulty of farming this tree) are also listed in the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Spider Tree is a Halloween Exclusive tree</li>\n<li>Can be logged using the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined axe</a> or higher.</li>\n<li>Can be sanded using the <a href=\"/wiki/Industrial_Sander\" title=\"Industrial Sander\">Industrial sander</a> or higher.</li>\n<li>Can be planked using the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Planker\" title=\"Steel Planker\">Steel planker</a> or higher.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Spider spawn conditions include the following:\n<ul><li>Spider trees must spawn on the surface.</li>\n<li>They usually spawn on stone/dirt (not to be confused with grass).</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2><p>\nThe various textures of the Spider Tree in its raw, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"372fd5e5701d0aaf753f1ff28a743f42\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spider_tree_log-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spider_tree_log.png\" title=\"Spider tree log.png (299 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Spider_tree_log.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006014424\" title=\"Spider tree log.png (299 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree log.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_log.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Spider tree log.png (299 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree log.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_log.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Spider_tree_log.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006014424\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spider_tree_sanded-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spider_tree_sanded.png\" title=\"Spider tree sanded.png (1.15 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/Spider_tree_sanded.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006015649\" title=\"Spider tree sanded.png (1.15 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree sanded.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_sanded.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Spider tree sanded.png (1.15 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree sanded.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_sanded.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/Spider_tree_sanded.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006015649\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spider_tree_planked-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spider_tree_planked.png\" title=\"Spider tree planked.png (530 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/12/Spider_tree_planked.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006015137\" title=\"Spider tree planked.png (530 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree planked.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_planked.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Spider tree planked.png (530 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Spider tree planked.png\" data-image-key=\"Spider_tree_planked.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/12/Spider_tree_planked.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251006015137\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tree drops ~10-15 spiders on the ground that chase you. But they are pretty slow and do low damage.</li>\n<li>the tree triggers my arachnophobia 😔</li>\n<li>Chopping this tree with the <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Axe\" title=\"Living Axe\">Living Axe</a>, will keep the spider webs in the branches, but the spiders still fall.</li>\n<li>Because of how spider trees generate, they can sometimes spawn on the side of hills, making them slightly glitch into terrain.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Spider Tree (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6U3BpZGVyX1RyZWU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Spider_Tree\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Spider_Tree?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</fig